{
  "_about": "The disabled client (design §2.1, §10 decisions 5 and 6, PR 3): construction inputs and what each gives, the option checks that hold on every client, and each method's behavior on a disabled client. Test values are fake: the key is app-keys.json's S key.",
  "construction": {
    "_comment": "Each case sets exactly env (every other variable unset: clear WAKESHIFT_KEY and WAKESHIFT_CORE first) and constructs with options, mapped per SDK: key (absent or null: TS key left out or undefined, Python key=None, Go no WithKey; a string: TS { key }, Python Wakeshift(key), Go WithKey(k)); required (TS required: true, Python required=True, Go Required()); core (TS core, Python core=, Go WithCore); max_retries (TS maxRetries, Python max_retries=, Go WithMaxRetries); timeout_seconds (TS timeoutMs = seconds * 1000, Python timeout=); log_level (TS logLevel); unknown (TS: an extra property with that name and value). want: enabled and the resolved core (only checked through the URL the SDK would call; no request is made); logs: exactly these warnings.json codes at construction (none: []); or error: construction throws (Go: New returns) UsageError with that code, its message containing says and none of must_not_contain (the key, fragments of it, its length). Construction makes no network request in any case. no_key logs once per client, at debug (logs here counts every level).",
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "no key anywhere: disabled, logged once at debug",
        "env": {},
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "enabled": false,
          "core": "https://app.wakeshift.ai",
          "logs": [
            {
              "code": "no_key",
              "level": "debug"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY set: enabled",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSV"
        },
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "enabled": true,
          "core": "https://app.wakeshift.ai",
          "logs": []
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY empty: missing",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": ""
        },
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "enabled": false,
          "core": "https://app.wakeshift.ai",
          "logs": [
            {
              "code": "no_key",
              "level": "debug"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY whitespace: missing",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "  \n"
        },
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "enabled": false,
          "core": "https://app.wakeshift.ai",
          "logs": [
            {
              "code": "no_key",
              "level": "debug"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY with whitespace around it: trimmed, enabled",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "  wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSV\n"
        },
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "enabled": true,
          "core": "https://app.wakeshift.ai",
          "logs": []
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY malformed: throws (the operator tried to turn Wakeshift on)",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSW"
        },
        "options": {},
        "want": {
          "error": "config",
          "says": "WAKESHIFT_KEY",
          "must_not_contain": [
            "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSW",
            "1116qJFW",
            "z9fWXzSW",
            "vUeyc2S6",
            "54",
            "50"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "WAKESHIFT_KEY malformed, required",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSW"
        },
        "options": {
          "required": true
        },
        "want": {
          "error": "config",
          "says": "WAKESHIFT_KEY",
          "must_not_contain": [
            "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSW",
            "1116qJFW",
            "z9fWXzSW",
            "vUeyc2S6",
            "54",
            "50"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "required and no key: throws",
        "env": {},
        "options": {
          "required": true
        },
        "want": {
          "error": "config",
          "says": "WAKESHIFT_KEY"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "required and WAKESHIFT_KEY empty: throws",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": " "
        },
        "options": {
          "required": true
        },
        "want": {
          "error": "config",
          "says": "WAKESHIFT_KEY"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "required and a key: enabled",
        "env": {
          "WAKESHIFT_KEY": "wst_1116qJFWMMHFy3xDdLmvUeyc2S6FrWRhJP51HsvDYdz9fWXzSV"
